The program can also be tested with four uploaded images.

The required files are:

Dog_01.jpg
Dog_02.jpg
Animal_Name_01.jpg
Object_Name_01.jpg

Dog_01.jpg should contain a dog with a known breed.

Animal_Name_01.jpg should contain an animal that is not a dog.

Object_Name_01.jpg should contain an object that is not an animal.

Dog_02.jpg should be a horizontally flipped version of Dog_01.jpg, or an upside-down version if necessary.

The four images are placed in:

uploaded_images/

The images should be JPEG files with a .jpg extension and should be approximately square.
